From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:01:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Treasure Trails: hard coordinate wizards and the Double agent

Hard coordinates with a combat encounter (cluehelper_combat_encounter: Saradomin wizard, or the
Zamorak wizard in the Wilderness) summon the wizard on the first dig ("For Saradomin!" / "Die,
human!", OSRS Wiki); it attacks, and the dig pays only after it is killed. Hard emote steps after
the first step summon the Double agent ("I expect you to die!"; level 108, or 65 in the
Wilderness) before Uri; killing it in the clue's outfit brings Uri at once, otherwise the emote is
done again. Kills are seen through an NpcDeathKillHook. `::clue solve` solves the held puzzle box
(test shortcut). Integration tests.
